DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaccppiiaallss driver supports ACPI ambient light sensor devices and pro‐
     vides information about the ambient light environment in which the system
     is currently operating.  Ambient light illuminance is read every second
     and can be monitored using sysctl(8) or sensorsd(8).

